-- Imports existing Square customer contacts (from two Square directory exports
-- dated 2026-08-04) into the newsletter subscribers list. These are existing
-- customers; contacts whose Square "Email Subscription Status" was "unsubscribed"
-- or "bounced" were excluded before this file was generated. Phone numbers are
-- normalized to digits with an optional leading "+". ON CONFLICT (email) DO
-- NOTHING makes this safe to re-run and never overwrites a genuine on-site
-- signup already on the list.
ON CONFLICT ("email") DO NOTHING;
